{"data": [{"author_id": "2116175062323613697", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:09:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116593344470274347"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AHLuvu9p4i", "end": 264, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OryxInvMarkets/status/2116593344470274347/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116593307056766976", "start": 241, "url": "https://t.co/AHLuvu9p4i"}]}, "id": "2116593344470274347", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "US liquidity check, week to 28 Oct:\n\n• Bank reserves −$68.8bn, now below $2.9tn\n• Treasury cash +$47.7bn, back to ~$1tn\n• Reverse repo buffer: ~zero\n• SOFR 4bp above IORB\nNot stress yet. But the cushion is gone and the drain is speeding up. https://t.co/AHLuvu9p4i", "url": "https://x.com/OryxInvMarkets/status/2116593344470274347"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116606132823203921"], "id": "2116606132823203921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏛️ Traditional Markets &amp; Macro-Liquidity: October 31, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Liquidity Plumbing: A USD 70.48 billion weekly TGA build to USD 1,015.63 billion drained weekly-average bank reserves by USD 68.84 billion to USD 2,893.77 billion despite USD 3.65 billion", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2116606132823203921"}, {"author_id": "133371960", "created_at": "2026-10-30T14:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116168256700448879"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/asvlTSf2m2", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/garganirudh/status/2116168256700448879/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113896352736575488", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/asvlTSf2m2"}]}, "id": "2116168256700448879", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 497, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Post 6: Net Liquidity: the Fed's Balance Sheet, the TGA and the RRP.\n\nThe Fed shrank its balance sheet by over a trillion dollars and stocks rose. The answer sits in two accounts nobody watches.\n\nWhat it is\n\n-QE creates bank reserves; QT drains them. Two other Fed accounts sit https://t.co/asvlTSf2m2", "url": "https://x.com/garganirudh/status/2116168256700448879"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-10-30T19:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116243741090492709"], "id": "2116243741090492709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏛️ Traditional Markets &amp; Macro-Liquidity: October 30, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Liquidity Plumbing: The closing Treasury General Account surged USD 70.48 billion to USD 1,015.63 billion, draining bank reserves by USD 68.84 billion to USD 2,893.77 billion. Despite USD", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2116243741090492709"}, {"author_id": "1779871005193740288", "created_at": "2026-10-30T03:11:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116004943278846041"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 29, "start": 25, "tag": "ETH"}, {"end": 34, "start": 30, "tag": "XRP"}, {"end": 39, "start": 35, "tag": "SOL"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VBha1KaPGx", "end": 281, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BRW_Solo/status/2116004943278846041/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116004930997948416", "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/VBha1KaPGx"}]}, "id": "2116004943278846041", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1102, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "tx:native bitcoin:native $ETH\n$XRP $SOL\n\n🚨 This is the CORE PRIMARY REASON why altcoins have not seen liquidity in the markets yet\n\nWait till that BULLISH DESCENDING TRIANGLE breaks out 🔥🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀\n\nNet Liquidity=Fed total assets−TGA−overnight reverse repo (RRP) https://t.co/VBha1KaPGx", "url": "https://x.com/BRW_Solo/status/2116004943278846041"}, {"author_id": "331439614", "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:41:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116057829890994329"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The Federal Reserve Board of Governors in Washington DC.", "display_url": "federalreserve.gov/releases/h41/c…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h41/current/", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116057831249993728/DcFtGSH4?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116057831249993728/DcFtGSH4?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "Lock", "unwound_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h41/current/", "url": "https://t.co/NGjeYJPzJh"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/lL4BawftJ4", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/gymayong/status/2116057829890994329/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116057456652562432", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/lL4BawftJ4"}]}, "id": "2116057829890994329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bank reserves fell $68.8bn; Fed securities fell $2.4bn (weekly averages to Oct 28). That alone does not establish funding stress.\n\nIf funding tightens, US stocks could face pressure. Test: sustained SOFR–IORB widening.\n\nhttps://t.co/NGjeYJPzJh https://t.co/lL4BawftJ4", "url": "https://x.com/gymayong/status/2116057829890994329"}, {"author_id": "2014641243691581442", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:34:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116101499054870835"], "id": "2116101499054870835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's Central Bank: \n\n- To Conduct Overnight Reverse Repo Operations Each Working Day With Fixed Rate, Quantity Tender From Nov 2\n\n- Current Overnight Reverse Repo Operation Rate Is 1.25%\n\n- 7-Day Reverse Repo Operations Changed to Fixed Quantity, Rate Tender With Multiple", "url": "https://x.com/chartlyst/status/2116101499054870835"}, {"author_id": "2099790074686611458", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:59:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116107612987027638"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ALCoWZyM29", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MacrotapeIO/status/2116107612987027638/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116107607584751616", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/ALCoWZyM29"}]}, "id": "2116107612987027638", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "💰 The Treasury's cash account closed at $1,015.6bn on 28 October, from $945.2bn a week earlier — $70.4bn out of the banking system and into a chequebook. The peak came a day earlier: a record $1,052.5bn close on 27 October.\n\n📉 Reserve balances fell $68.8bn over the same seven https://t.co/ALCoWZyM29", "url": "https://x.com/MacrotapeIO/status/2116107612987027638"}, {"author_id": "2022599713724276736", "created_at": "2026-10-30T10:05:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116109146173178019"], "id": "2116109146173178019", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s central bank will conduct overnight reverse repo operations every working day starting next Monday as it moves toward using the overnight reverse repo rate as its main policy anchor.", "url": "https://x.com/movesurge/status/2116109146173178019"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116591032506765768"], "id": "2116591032506765768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚖️ Market Intelligence Outlook Report: October 31, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Macro Overview: Federal Reserve Net Liquidity plunged USD 78.39 billion on a Wednesday close to USD 5,729.83 billion as the TGA reached USD 1,015.63 billion and bank reserves hit USD 2,893.77", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2116591032506765768"}, {"author_id": "1810528454812811264", "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:35:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116418848752848992"], "id": "2116418848752848992", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's central bank just announced a major overhaul of its monetary toolkit, officially making the overnight reverse repo its primary policy benchmark starting November 2. The 7-day reverse repo, which served as the anchor for years, is now taking a backseat to handle month-end", "url": "https://x.com/aoteman0214/status/2116418848752848992"}, {"author_id": "1942214670393176064", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:07:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116094632270389571"], "id": "2116094632270389571", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 538, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC: SETS OVERNIGHT REVERSE REPO RATE AT 1.25%", "url": "https://x.com/MarketNews_Feed/status/2116094632270389571"}, {"author_id": "59393368", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:05:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116094193924034746"], "id": "2116094193924034746", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10729, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "PBOC Sets Overnight Reverse Repo Rate At 1.25%", "url": "https://x.com/LiveSquawk/status/2116094193924034746"}, {"author_id": "2038630332790890496", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:07:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2