gencyLTD/status/2116471138331009395"}, {"author_id": "958924086306013184", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:25:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115948213156925660"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The Fed’s rate hold sets overnight funding terms and opens the door to Treasury-bill purchases that could shape Bitcoin’s liquidity outlook.", "display_url": "ift.tt/whrFnMX", "end": 105, "expanded_url": "https://ift.tt/whrFnMX", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115948215736422400/f-GmDTqf?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115948215736422400/f-GmDTqf?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 82, "status": 200, "title": "The Fed's rate freeze will mean nothing unless banks fix a repo market bottleneck", "unwound_url": "https://cryptoslate.com/the-feds-rate-freeze-will-mean-nothing-unless-banks-fix-a-repo-market-bottleneck/", "url": "https://t.co/XH3nKuTtMh"}, {"description": "Independent crypto news, live prices, and market analysis since 2017. Follow Bitcoin, Ethereum, daily headlines, research, and market data.", "display_url": "ift.tt/bp38w10", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://ift.tt/bp38w10", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115042186018365440/t91voT6M?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115042186018365440/t91voT6M?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "Crypto News, Coin Prices & Market Trends | CryptoSlate", "unwound_url": "https://cryptoslate.com/", "url": "https://t.co/wn0YKFIhaW"}]}, "id": "2115948213156925660", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Fed’s rate freeze will mean nothing unless banks fix a repo market bottleneck https://t.co/XH3nKuTtMh Gino Matos \nThe October 29 settings put reserve interest at 3.90%, standing repo at 4.00% and reverse repo at 3.75%, each supporting rate control.\n\n… https://t.co/wn0YKFIhaW", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoPlanet247/status/2115948213156925660"}, {"author_id": "2103569126031499264", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:10:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116095498616758478"], "id": "2116095498616758478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The PBOC will begin daily overnight reverse-repo tenders at 1.25% from Nov. 2 and change its 7-day repo method, according to Yicai.", "url": "https://x.com/CrossmarketWire/status/2116095498616758478"}, {"author_id": "2088932449829187584", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:45:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116527010864562227"], "id": "2116527010864562227", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 CHINA’S CENTRAL BANK SHIFTS POLICY FRAMEWORK\n\nThe PBOC will conduct overnight reverse repos every business day starting November 2.\n\nThe operating rate is currently 1.25%, compared with 1.40% for the seven-day reverse repo.\n\nA significant step toward an overnight-rate-based", "url": "https://x.com/HansonYaoAu/status/2116527010864562227"}, {"author_id": "2026751861609607169", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:22:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115917204399218955"], "id": "2115917204399218955", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 593, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ATLAS PULSE | JUST IN: 🇦🇷 THE ARGENTINE PRESIDENCY ANNOUNCES A SWEEPING FISCAL RESTRUCTURING DECREE TO ACCELERATE CENTRAL BANK RESERVES STABILIZATION.", "url": "https://x.com/ATLAS_PULSEe/status/2115917204399218955"}, {"author_id": "1189953260637044737", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:12:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116186583728640056"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6xCS5TTSB7", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NGurushina/status/2116186583728640056/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116186529391353856", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/6xCS5TTSB7"}]}, "id": "2116186583728640056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 3074, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "China - The PBoC announced that its new key policy rate (1.25% o/n reverse repo) will become operational on Monday. We see it as an attempt to improve the transmission mechanism (rather than easing per se) by bringing the policy rate more in line with interbank liquidity needs https://t.co/6xCS5TTSB7", "url": "https://x.com/NGurushina/status/2116186583728640056"}, {"author_id": "2080189737915310080", "created_at": "2026-10-30T17:10:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116216057786700166"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/QKjo674Hso", "end": 288, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bugaizhou/status/2116216057786700166/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116088520137953280", "start": 265, "url": "https://t.co/QKjo674Hso"}]}, "id": "2116216057786700166", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Fed's Oct 28 implementation note set IORB at 3.90%, standing repo at 4.00% and overnight reverse repo at 3.75%, effective Oct 29. \nThese anchor overnight funding, not a data center's multi-year loan rate. For AI capex, track term yields and credit spreads too. https://t.co/QKjo674Hso", "url": "https://x.com/bugaizhou/status/2116216057786700166"}, {"author_id": "1906745222404378625", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:32:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116146143784505477"], "id": "2116146143784505477", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The PBOC just officially made the overnight reverse repo its main daily tool. Starting Nov 2 it runs every business day at a fixed 1.25%. The 7-day (1.40%) moves to month-ends and tax periods only. China's policy anchor is shifting to an overnight rate, much like the Fed's.", "url": "https://x.com/macro_fengshui/status/2116146143784505477"}, {"author_id": "710457722278256640", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:06:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116532244718497806"], "id": "2116532244718497806", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 151, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "central bank is inherently long USD, borrows money at almost zero cost (bank reserves), so if a central bank posts abnormal good profits, it is not a great signal", "url": "https://x.com/PoirotHercule5/status/2116532244718497806"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2116175062323613697", "name": "ORYX Global", "username": "OryxInvMarkets"}, {"id": "203321243", "name": "Marty Ray Gold", "username": "Marty_Au79"}, {"id": "133371960", "name": "Anirudh Garg", "username": "garganirudh"}, {"id": "1779871005193740288", "name": "BRW_Solo🔥", "username": "BRW_Solo"}, {"id": "331439614", "name": "Smoky | Macro & US Equities", "username": "gymayong"}, {"id": "2014641243691581442", "name": "Chartlyst", "username": "chartlyst"}, {"id": "2099790074686611458", "name": "Macrotape.io", "username": "MacrotapeIO"}, {"id": "2022599713724276736", "name": "movesurge", "username": "movesurge"}, {"id": "1810528454812811264", "name": "Ryan", "username": "aoteman0214"}, {"id": "1942214670393176064", "name": "MarketNewsFeed", "username": "MarketNews_Feed"}, {"id": "59393368", "name": "LiveSquawk", "username": "LiveSquawk"}, {"id": "2038630332790890496", "name": "Aello", "username": "Aelloradar"}, {"id": "3295423333", "name": "First Squawk", "username": "FirstSquawk"}, {"id": "2010054891688099843", "name": "Arete", "username": "AreteAgencyLTD"}, {"id": "958924